      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَلَتٌ</span></b>  <i>Escape:</i> one says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَيْسَ لَكَ مِنْ هٰذَا الأَمْرِ</span>
